EASY INTERVIEW MEMORY TRICK
===================================

Scheduler
    ↓
Container
    ↓
Pod
    ↓
Service
    ↓
Ingress
    ↓
Node
    ↓
Application
    ↓
Database

Remember:
"Scheduler → Container → Pod → Service → Ingress → Node → Application → Database"

This is the order most production Kubernetes troubleshooting follows and is a strong framework for DevOps interviews.
